OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after suspicious
OL,4,Apackage found
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral homes have been evacuated in a
OL,7,Fvillage in Nottinghamshire after a
OL,8,Fsuspicious package was discovered
OL,9,Foutside a property.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said it was
OL,12,Fcalled to an address in Westdale Road
OL,13,Fin Jacksdale at about 07:50 BST on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FThe force said "out of caution" nearby
OL,17,Fproperties were evacuated while
OL,18,Fexplosive ordinance disposal engineers
OL,19,Fcarried out further investigations.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
