OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after suspicious
OL,4,Apackage found
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said residents affected by the
OL,7,Fevacuation could go to Jacksdale Garden
OL,8,FCentre, which has been made available
OL,9,Fas a place of safety.
